00:17:57,119 --> 00:17:58,040
(The story starts here)
It's my pleasure.

573
00:17:59,926 --> 00:18:01,261
(Lu Bingkun)

574
00:18:02,080 --> 00:18:03,290
(Young mistress in makeup)

575
00:18:03,520 --> 00:18:04,704
(Eating in the corner)

576
00:18:04,920 --> 00:18:06,479
You're zoomed in 4x.

577
00:18:07,760 --> 00:18:08,959
Stop being weird.

578
00:18:08,959 --> 00:18:10,400
This part can't be used.

579
00:18:12,439 --> 00:18:13,520
What do you want to say

580
00:18:13,520 --> 00:18:14,719
about your close-up portrait?

581
00:18:17,719 --> 00:18:19,640
I hope the rain will let up a bit later.

582
00:18:21,359 --> 00:18:23,040
(Young mistress's styling complete)
Today we're doing an imperial makeover.

583
00:18:24,959 --> 00:18:25,880
Wait, why is it filming me?

584
00:18:25,880 --> 00:18:26,479
(Trying to tame the camera)
It should be filming you.

585
00:18:28,119 --> 00:18:28,640
Zoom in.

586
00:18:32,719 --> 00:18:33,560
I've got some camera movement.

587
00:18:34,000 --> 00:18:35,439
What will you say
when you see the young mistress?

588
00:18:35,744 --> 00:18:36,400
(Where's the young mistress?)

589
00:18:36,400 --> 00:18:38,040
The young mistress
has disappeared from the mirror.

590
00:18:41,719 --> 00:18:43,040
What will you say
when you see the young mistress?

591
00:18:45,040 --> 00:18:45,680
What will you say?

592
00:18:47,400 --> 00:18:48,359
Greeting, Your Highness.

593
00:18:49,560 --> 00:18:50,839
I'm a mistress, not a consort.

594
00:18:51,280 --> 00:18:51,760
I can't tell the difference.

595
00:18:52,439 --> 00:18:52,800
About the same.

596
00:18:52,800 --> 00:18:53,760
As long as you get the gist.

597
00:18:56,760 --> 00:18:57,719
Say hello, Your Highness.

598
00:18:58,680 --> 00:19:01,319
Any thoughts on going home today?

599
00:19:01,599 --> 00:19:03,280
Have I been downgraded already?

600
00:19:03,719 --> 00:19:04,800
I haven't been home for a long time.

601
00:19:04,800 --> 00:19:05,359
You might later

602
00:19:05,359 --> 00:19:06,199
only be sent to the Cold Palace.

603
00:19:06,800 --> 00:19:07,880
Cold Palace will serve you cold dishes.

604
00:19:08,760 --> 00:19:10,280
The most beautiful concubine
in the Cold Palace.

605
00:19:11,560 --> 00:19:12,239
Outside the Cold Palace too.

606
00:19:12,736 --> 00:19:14,076
(Clip of Lu Bingkun as a child)

607
00:19:14,076 --> 00:19:15,744
(in the play The Strange Case
of the Little Cabbage)

608
00:19:16,280 --> 00:19:18,199
(Time for interrogation)
How many concubines have you banished?

609
00:19:18,920 --> 00:19:19,199
I...

610
00:19:19,680 --> 00:19:20,760
I have no concubines.

611
00:19:20,760 --> 00:19:21,560
No Cold Palace.

612
00:19:22,280 --> 00:19:23,000
I only have WeChat.

613
00:19:23,920 --> 00:19:24,599
(Time for interrogation)
Do you know WeChat?

614
00:19:25,640 --> 00:19:26,680
I know We Can't.

615
00:19:27,119 --> 00:19:27,880
What's We Can't?

616
00:19:29,199 --> 00:19:31,160
We can't talk. We have to use WeChat.

617
00:19:35,800 --> 00:19:36,880
Do you know QQ?

618
00:19:38,479 --> 00:19:40,199
That's about the next century.

619
00:19:41,400 --> 00:19:41,959
For the young people.

620
00:19:47,079 --> 00:19:47,800
Ready to go.

621
00:19:49,160 --> 00:19:50,079
Let me escort
Your Highness back to the palace.

622
00:19:51,280 --> 00:19:51,640
Let's go.

623
00:19:52,119 --> 00:19:54,000
It takes me seven minutes to walk home.

624
00:19:54,439 --> 00:19:55,719
This umbrella is really luxurious.

625
00:19:57,040 --> 00:19:57,880
We're entering the palace.

626
00:19:58,080 --> 00:19:59,776
(Young mistress returns to the palace)

627
00:20:00,479 --> 00:20:02,079
Today's rain is really...

628
00:20:02,079 --> 00:20:04,359
Like the day Yiping
asked her dad for money.

629
00:20:05,800 --> 00:20:07,800
As if stepping into Romance in the Rain.

630
00:20:07,800 --> 00:20:09,079
You haven't watched this drama,
have you?

631
00:20:09,760 --> 00:20:11,160
(After the ice-skating An Lingrong)
I can't catch your reference.

632
00:20:11,160 --> 00:20:11,680
(Second reference that can't be catched)
Sorry.

633
00:20:13,400 --> 00:20:14,000
It's my first time here.

634
00:20:14,800 --> 00:20:15,880
It's also my first time
at the Forbidden City.

635
00:20:16,760 --> 00:20:17,800
Aren't you just visiting home?

636
00:20:19,000 --> 00:20:20,239
I don't come home often.

637
00:20:20,239 --> 00:20:20,880
Don't come home often.

638
00:20:21,319 --> 00:20:23,199
Previously, it was the Shanghai version
of the Forbidden City.

639
00:20:24,319 --> 00:20:26,160
Before that was the Disney version.

640
00:20:26,720 --> 00:20:30,624
(Consort going home (Beijing version))

641
00:20:31,072 --> 00:20:32,416
(Jia Peixuan)

642
00:20:33,760 --> 00:20:34,959
I'll start then.

643
00:20:35,439 --> 00:20:37,479
Anyway, we'll make
the same dishes today.

644
00:20:37,959 --> 00:20:38,959
(Today's dishes: Tomato and scrambled eggs)
Tomato and scrambled eggs.

645
00:20:39,520 --> 00:20:41,199
(Garlic baby bok choy)
Garlic baby bok choy, right?

646
00:20:41,199 --> 00:20:42,599
I'm making lettuce.

647
00:20:45,400 --> 00:20:47,079
You told me to make baby bok choy.

648
00:20:48,079 --> 00:20:49,199
I'm making lettuce.

649
00:20:49,199 --> 00:20:49,680
Whatever.

650
00:20:51,648 --> 00:20:52,359
(Mime performance)

651
00:20:52,359 --> 00:20:53,359
I have already started cooking.

652
00:20:55,920 --> 00:20:57,199
Is this a mime act?

653
00:20:59,232 --> 00:21:00,160
(Stopping)

654
00:21:00,160 --> 00:21:01,040
My face looks so dark looking this way.

655
00:21:01,040 --> 00:21:02,040
If you use three eggs, I'll use four.

656
00:21:02,040 --> 00:21:04,160
You want to eat more than I do, huh?

657
00:21:04,160 --> 00:21:05,400
I have to surpass you.

658
00:21:05,400 --> 00:21:06,760
I have to surpass you in everything.

659
00:21:07,239 --> 00:21:08,359
Is this the rivalry lane?

660
00:21:08,928 --> 00:21:09,788
(Jia Peixuan, Xiao Wentao)

661
00:21:09,788 --> 00:21:10,976
(Rivalry lane couple cooking showdown)

662
00:21:11,280 --> 00:21:12,319
I feel like I'm done cooking.

663
00:21:12,319 --> 00:21:13,239
You haven't even started.

664
00:21:13,800 --> 00:21:14,079
Impossible.

665
00:21:15,119 --> 00:21:16,119
(Confident)
I cook really fast.

666
00:21:16,920 --> 00:21:18,680
(Well-prepared)
I prepped the ingredients in advance.

667
00:21:19,400 --> 00:21:20,400
I did it on purpose.

668
00:21:20,400 --> 00:21:21,280
Did it on purpose.

669
00:21:21,800 --> 00:21:22,599
I just let you prep first.

670
00:21:22,599 --> 00:21:23,920
Just to let you know

671
00:21:23,920 --> 00:21:24,760
the difference between
someone who can cook

672
00:21:24,760 --> 00:21:26,359
and someone who can't.

673
00:21:26,880 --> 00:21:27,479
Give me a break.

674
00:21:27,479 --> 00:21:28,599
I can cook, alright?

675
00:21:29,359 --> 00:21:30,119
It was me that did all the cooking.

676
00:21:31,000 --> 00:21:31,959
You just eat.

677
00:21:33,000 --> 00:21:33,760
May I ask,

678
00:21:33,760 --> 00:21:35,760
have you ever had my cola chicken wings?

679
00:21:36,239 --> 00:21:37,920
You made it once in the house.

680
00:21:37,920 --> 00:21:39,199
But I...

681
00:21:39,199 --> 00:21:40,079
Didn't you get to eat it?

682
00:21:41,000 --> 00:21:42,239
I don't think I did.

683
00:21:42,239 --> 00:21:43,400
It was all shared out, right?

684
00:21:43,760 --> 00:21:45,199
Don't blame me then.

685
00:21:45,199 --> 00:21:46,160
You didn't keep any for me.

686
00:21:46,784 --> 00:21:47,560
(Can't believe it)

687
00:21:47,560 --> 00:21:48,319
What?

688
00:21:50,920 --> 00:21:51,280
Well...

689
00:21:51,839 --> 00:21:53,680
What kind of blame-shifting is this?

690
00:21:53,680 --> 00:21:54,359
(I'm not taking the blame)

691
00:21:54,359 --> 00:21:55,199
You're really something.

692
00:21:56,920 --> 00:21:58,199
I've already added the tomatoes.

693
00:21:58,199 --> 00:21:59,776
(Starting to cook)

694
00:22:00,640 --> 00:22:02,359
Look how pretty mine looks.

695
00:22:02,359 --> 00:22:03,599
Perfect in color, aroma, and taste.

696
00:22:03,599 --> 00:22:04,400
I have never eaten it.

697
00:22:04,400 --> 00:22:05,800
Okay.

698
00:22:05,800 --> 00:22:06,760
When you came to my place,

699
00:22:06,760 --> 00:22:08,199
didn't I cook it for you?

700
00:22:08,199 --> 00:22:09,079
You ungrateful brat.

701
00:22:09,079 --> 00:22:09,400
You didn't.

702
00:22:09,400 --> 00:22:11,239
I have never had
your tomato scrambled eggs.

703
00:22:11,239 --> 00:22:12,839
Haven't you had my tomato beef brisket?

704
00:22:12,839 --> 00:22:13,640
No.

705
00:22:13,640 --> 00:22:14,800
I've never been to your place.

706
00:22:14,800 --> 00:22:16,288
(Amused)

707
00:22:16,880 --> 00:22:17,599
Okay.

708
00:22:17,599 --> 00:22:18,920
A dog came to my place.

709
00:22:18,920 --> 00:22:20,704
(Not this one)

710
00:22:20,800 --> 00:22:22,199
A thief came to my place.

711
00:22:24,560 --> 00:22:26,000
My tomato scrambled eggs

712
00:22:26,760 --> 00:22:28,640
are out of the wok now.

713
00:22:28,640 --> 00:22:30,848
(Audience eats first)

714
00:22:31,319 --> 00:22:33,760
(Chef Xiao still busy)
I'm starting to cook the oyster sauce lettuce.

715
00:22:34,239 --> 00:22:35,760
Should I wait for you?

716
00:22:36,239 --> 00:22:36,599
No.

717
00:22:40,359 --> 00:22:41,160
(Sis dotes on you)
I'll wait for you.

718
00:22:43,760 --> 00:22:45,319
I'll wash the dishes by the way.

719
00:22:46,560 --> 00:22:49,560
Who do you think cooks the best
in the house?

720
00:22:50,199 --> 00:22:51,079
That's definitely me.

721
00:22:51,079 --> 00:22:52,239
(Only taking first place)

722
00:22:52,239 --> 00:22:53,479
Besides you?

723
00:22:54,119 --> 00:22:55,199
The second best.

724
00:22:55,760 --> 00:22:56,479
You.

725
00:22:58,680 --> 00:22:59,760
You're really a sweet talker.

726
00:23:00,160 --> 00:23:02,176
(Continuing to cook)

727
00:23:02,760 --> 00:23:04,119
This color is so pretty.

728
00:23:04,599 --> 00:23:05,408
This camera work.

729
00:23:06,319 --> 00:23:08,920
I'm done again. What should I do?

730
00:23:08,920 --> 00:23:09,560
(Finished first)

731
00:23:09,560 --> 00:23:10,280
It's done.

732
00:23:10,280 --> 00:23:11,359
(Right behind)
I cook really fast.

733
00:23:12,160 --> 00:23:12,520
Take a look.

734
00:23:13,640 --> 00:23:14,640
One is this, the other is this.

735
00:23:15,400 --> 00:23:16,839
I bought some cherry tomatoes too.

736
00:23:16,992 --> 00:23:19,160
(Connected at heart)

737
00:23:19,160 --> 00:23:20,160
What will you do tomorrow?

738
00:23:21,560 --> 00:23:24,040
I'll record something tomorrow.

739
00:23:24,040 --> 00:23:26,920
And I'll meet up with a friend.

740
00:23:26,920 --> 00:23:28,319
A friend of mine has come to Beijing.

741
00:23:29,199 --> 00:23:30,640
I'll take him out for a meal.

742
00:23:31,959 --> 00:23:32,959
Will you miss me tomorrow?

743
00:23:34,176 --> 00:23:36,256
(Suddenly choked)

744
00:23:37,280 --> 00:23:38,400
Speak properly.

745
00:23:39,359 --> 00:23:41,599
Okay, what's this tomato?

746
00:23:41,959 --> 00:23:42,640
Okay.

747
00:23:43,760 --> 00:23:44,319
That's it.

748
00:23:45,280 --> 00:23:46,680
(Immediately gives in)
I'll miss you.

749
00:23:48,082 --> 00:23:49,728
(Successfully appeased)

750
00:23:50,280 --> 00:23:51,079
What will you do tomorrow?

751
00:23:51,959 --> 00:23:53,400
I have an event tomorrow afternoon.

752
00:23:53,400 --> 00:23:55,359
(Daily Rivalry 1/2)
Okay, you'll get to show off again.

753
00:23:57,400 --> 00:23:58,040
What the heck?

754
00:23:58,599 --> 00:23:59,400
I have an event too.

755
00:24:01,119 --> 00:24:02,439
I'll just go downstairs
to stretch myself.

756
00:24:03,439 --> 00:24:04,040
Have you noticed it?

757
00:24:04,040 --> 00:24:05,000
You love competing with me.

758
00:24:05,680 --> 00:24:06,119
No, I don't.

759
00:24:08,439 --> 00:24:10,040
I saw a netizen say

760
00:24:10,040 --> 00:24:11,680
we've always been on the rivalry lane.

761
00:24:12,319 --> 00:24:14,760
We've been on the rivalry lane
since archery.

762
00:24:15,520 --> 00:24:16,000
Can't help it.

763
00:24:16,760 --> 00:24:18,199
Just like to be competitive.

764
00:24:19,280 --> 00:24:20,680
Do we have to fight
over winning and losing?

765
00:24:21,560 --> 00:24:22,920
Isn't that hurtful?

766
00:24:23,959 --> 00:24:25,239
I haven't let you win, you mean?

767
00:24:25,920 --> 00:24:27,439
Right, you have never let me win.

768
00:24:27,439 --> 00:24:28,199
Say that again?

769
00:24:31,040 --> 00:24:32,040
When have you ever let me win?

770
00:24:32,880 --> 00:24:34,000
Didn't I let you win at badminton?

771
00:24:36,319 --> 00:24:37,760
So you let me win at badminton.

772
00:24:37,760 --> 00:24:39,079
At tennis, I let you win, right?

773
00:24:43,479 --> 00:24:44,560
At tennis, you let me win?

774
00:24:46,880 --> 00:24:48,160
That's right.

775
00:24:48,160 --> 00:24:49,040
That's sleep talk.

776
00:24:50,920 --> 00:24:52,319
Let's bet big next time.

777
00:24:54,912 --> 00:24:56,000
(Anytime Summon Card)

778
00:24:56,000 --> 00:24:57,599
This card is now in my hands.

779
00:24:58,119 --> 00:24:59,880
Next round, whoever wins

780
00:24:59,880 --> 00:25:01,160
will get the card.

781
00:25:01,160 --> 00:25:01,920
Why?

782
00:25:01,920 --> 00:25:04,239
This card was originally mine.

783
00:25:04,680 --> 00:25:06,199
How can you be so unfair?

784
00:25:06,199 --> 00:25:07,199
You're impossible.

785
00:25:07,199 --> 00:25:07,920
I can't help it.

786
00:25:07,920 --> 00:25:09,400
Why did you give me the card
in the first place?

787
00:25:10,199 --> 00:25:10,880
Useless.

788
00:25:10,880 --> 00:25:12,199
You're unreasonable.

789
00:25:12,680 --> 00:25:13,680
You're being unreasonable.

790
00:25:14,959 --> 00:25:15,760
You finished all the dishes?

791
00:25:18,400 --> 00:25:18,839
Almost done.

792
00:25:25,102 --> 00:25:27,104
(Today's rivalry ends)

793
00:25:27,648 --> 00:25:28,960
(Xiao Wentao)

794
00:25:30,880 --> 00:25:32,719
For my energetic guy,

795
00:25:32,719 --> 00:25:33,560
apply nail polish.

796
00:25:35,439 --> 00:25:36,479
It's almost dry.

797
00:25:39,239 --> 00:25:40,079
My

798
00:25:40,079 --> 00:25:42,439
nails are finally recovering.

799
00:25:42,800 --> 00:25:43,920
I want to apply this color.

800
00:25:46,359 --> 00:25:47,359
Aren't they all like that?

801
00:25:49,531 --> 00:25:50,176
(Reverse display)

802
00:25:52,040 --> 00:25:54,119
Yeah, showing it in reverse.

803
00:25:54,640 --> 00:25:55,880
Today, we eat this.

804
00:25:55,880 --> 00:25:57,040
Today, I'm applying this color.

805
00:25:57,959 --> 00:25:58,640
Take a look, you guys.

806
00:26:01,599 --> 00:26:02,560
Super sexy.

807
00:26:05,239 --> 00:26:06,239
My hands look so nice.

808
00:26:13,479 --> 00:26:14,640
Is this a banana leaf fan?

809
00:26:16,280 --> 00:26:17,319
Princess Iron Fan.

810
00:26:17,959 --> 00:26:19,239
This is my first time

811
00:26:19,239 --> 00:26:20,560
doing nails for a guy.

812
00:26:20,959 --> 00:26:21,439
Really?

813
00:26:22,239 --> 00:26:22,640
Yeah.

814
00:26:22,959 --> 00:26:24,599
Usually, guys don't do this.

815
00:26:24,599 --> 00:26:25,160
Yeah.

816
00:26:31,760 --> 00:26:32,880
Not bad.

817
00:26:32,880 --> 00:26:33,839
It looks pretty.

818
00:26:33,839 --> 00:26:35,359
Started a new business.

819
00:26:35,839 --> 00:26:36,560
Doing nail art.

820
00:26:36,560 --> 00:26:38,000
Now I know what to do with this.

821
00:26:39,239 --> 00:26:40,119
Draw two lines.

822
00:26:41,439 --> 00:26:41,760
Sure.

823
00:26:45,760 --> 00:26:46,479
What's wrong?

824
00:26:46,479 --> 00:26:46,800
Nothing.

825
00:26:50,079 --> 00:26:50,839
I think it's not right.

826
00:26:57,160 --> 00:26:58,000
A little crooked is okay.

827
00:27:00,800 --> 00:27:01,640
(Encouraging boyfriend)
No problem.

828
00:27:01,920 --> 00:27:02,479
Really?

829
00:27:02,479 --> 00:27:02,800
No problem.

830
00:27:03,920 --> 00:27:05,079
I don't even dare to breathe.

831
00:27:06,000 --> 00:27:06,839
I'm holding my breath.

832
00:27:09,239 --> 00:27:09,839
It's ruined.

833
00:27:09,839 --> 00:27:10,479
This one is even more crooked.

834
00:27:16,400 --> 00:27:16,839
Honestly.

835
00:27:16,839 --> 00:27:18,439
I think this is actually
a bit unnecessary.

836
00:27:28,599 --> 00:27:30,479
Today's is a simple version of nail art.

837
00:27:30,479 --> 00:27:31,239
Today's is simple.

838
00:27:31,239 --> 00:27:32,839
But you did it really well.

839
00:27:38,640 --> 00:27:39,719
Jia Nail Art.

840
00:27:44,400 --> 00:27:44,880
Look.

841
00:27:46,160 --> 00:27:47,880
Are you satisfied with my service today?

842
00:27:51,359 --> 00:27:52,880
Could you give me a five-star rating?

843
00:27:57,632 --> 00:27:58,944
(Xu Lvyang)

844
00:27:59,839 --> 00:28:00,280
First one.

845
00:28:00,280 --> 00:28:01,560
Love at first sight
or love that grows over time?

846
00:28:01,560 --> 00:28:02,199
Three, two, one.

847
00:28:02,199 --> 00:28:02,640
Love at first sight.

